Description: Ship the viewer notice catalogs in eight languages
 .
 The three strings of the viewer notice in Polish, Brazilian
 Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean and Simplified and
 Traditional Chinese (English stays in the code), installed with
 ki18n_install(po). A first draft written with AI assistance,
 pending review by native speakers.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-07
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
